# Bulk import rules

- Accept `.txt` and `.md` files.
- Extract every valid http/https URL with a robust regex.
- Ignore markdown formatting noise, `#` comments, and empty lines.
- Support: one URL per line, `Title | URL`, URL with trailing comment.
- Dedupe against existing queue URLs and download archive.
- Always preview counts and require confirmation before enqueue.
